<title>FRANCE: Algeria buys 50,000 tns French wheat - traders.</title>
<headline>Algeria buys 50,000 tns French wheat - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria bought at a tender 50,000 tonnes of French soft wheat at $172.50 per tonne, including freight and the cost of a Coface export credit, European grain traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>Substracting freight and Coface costs, this gives a Fob price of $143.50 per tonne, they said</p>
<p>The wheat is for shipment in January.</p>
</text>
